[size=6][b]Realtime Map from seed[/b][/size]

A realtime map of your Valheim server in a browser, through the Realtime Map from seed companion mod at [url=https://thevalheim.wiki/map]thevalheim.wiki[/url]. See your position and nearby creatures with their stars and distances.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/valheim-wiki/live-seed-map/main/listing/screenshots/map-player.png[/img]
[i]The live map connected to Valheim, showing the player and nearby creatures[/i]

[size=4][b]Find the nearest place[/b][/size]

Search from where you stand. This connected game shows Burial Chambers sorted by distance from the player.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/valheim-wiki/live-seed-map/main/listing/screenshots/search-results.png[/img]
[i]Burial Chambers search results ordered by distance from the connected player[/i]

[size=4][b]Your portals[/b][/size]

Select a portal pair to see both ends and the connection between them.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/valheim-wiki/live-seed-map/main/listing/screenshots/portals-moder.png[/img]
[i]The selected Moder portal pair linked across the map[/i]

[size=4][b]Track a place in your game[/b][/size]

Pick a map target and choose [b]Track in game[/b]. Here Haldor is tracked at 2.6 km in the browser and in Valheim.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/valheim-wiki/live-seed-map/main/listing/screenshots/haldor-tracked.png[/img]
[i]Haldor tracked at 2.6 km on the connected browser map[/i]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/valheim-wiki/live-seed-map/main/listing/screenshots/game-haldor-ping.png[/img]
[i]The running Valheim game showing the matching Haldor 2.6 km ping[/i]

[size=4][b]Install[/b][/size]

1. Install BepInExPack Valheim, then Realtime Map from seed with your mod manager or extract the manual ZIP into your Valheim folder.
2. Start Valheim and load your world.
3. Open [url=https://thevalheim.wiki/map]thevalheim.wiki/map[/url] and press [b]Connect game[/b]. If your browser asks, allow the website to connect to your game.

On Apple Silicon, follow [url=https://thevalheim.wiki/guides/mods-on-mac]Valheim mods on Mac[/url] before installing the mod.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/valheim-wiki/live-seed-map/main/listing/screenshots/home-connected.png[/img]
[i]The site showing Connected and Follow me on the map with Valheim running[/i]

Follow the [url=https://thevalheim.wiki/guides/live-seed-map]Realtime Map from seed installation guide[/url] for step-by-step setup and help connecting your game.

Support development at [url=https://ko-fi.com/thevalheimwiki]Ko-fi[/url].
